B.byq=new A.eT("1. Acceptance of Terms","By accessing and using the Madio Express platform, you agree to be bound by these terms of service. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, you may not access the service.")
B.byi=new A.eT("2. Service Description","Madio Express is an e-commerce platform that allows users to create and manage virtual stores, including product management, order processing, inventory control, and online payments.")
B.byl=new A.eT("3. User Accounts","To use the service, you must create an account by providing accurate and complete information. You are responsible for maintaining the security of your account and password. Madio Express will not be liable for losses caused by unauthorized use of your account.")
B.by5=new A.eT("4. Acceptable Use","You agree not to use the platform for illegal, fraudulent activities, or activities that violate the rights of third parties. We reserve the right to suspend or cancel accounts that violate these terms.")
B.byb=new A.eT("5. Payments and Billing","Paid plans are billed according to the selected period (monthly or annual). The first 3 months of paid plans are free.")
B.byr=new A.eT("6. Intellectual Property","The content, design, and code of Madio Express are the property of the company. Users retain ownership of their data, products, and images uploaded to the platform.")
B.byA=new A.eT("7. Liability","Madio Express provides the service with the diligence and quality the law requires, and is responsible for security and operational failures of the platform attributable to it. It is not responsible for the quality, delivery or warranty of the products each store sells to its customers, which are the store's responsibility as the seller, without prejudice to what Colombian law provides. Nothing herein limits the warranties or rights that Law 1480 of 2011 grants to users.")
B.bye=new A.eT("8. Your Obligations as a Seller (Law 1480 of 2011)","Towards your store's buyers you are the seller and you are responsible for the products: truthful and complete product information, total price with taxes and itemized shipping, delivery within the stated period and never later than 30 calendar days, a minimum one-year legal warranty on new products, the right of withdrawal (5 business days, refund within 15 calendar days), payment reversal in the cases set by law, and answers to requests, complaints and claims within 15 business days. Every promotion must have an end date; the platform does not allow saving one without it. Your store's email and phone are shown to buyers as the seller's identification (footer, tracking page and confirmation email) and receive reversal requests: keep them up to date. Madio Express will hand your store's identification to the Superintendence of Industry and Commerce (SIC) when it requires it.")
B.byu=new A.eT("9. Automatic Communications and Proof of Consent","By creating your store you authorize Madio Express to send, on behalf of your store, the acknowledgement of receipt of every order to the buyer (required by law; cannot be disabled) and the new-order notification to your email (this one you can disable). Your online store shows buyers the terms and conditions, the privacy policy, their consumer rights, the payment-reversal form and the link to the SIC, with texts provided by the platform that you can review from your store's footer. Madio Express keeps as evidence each buyer's acceptance of those terms and personal-data authorization (date, text version, IP address and browser) and makes it available to you as data controller.")
B.byt=new A.eT("10. Contact","For questions about these terms, contact us via WhatsApp at +57 311 311 4315 or through our social media channels.")
